//  Version      | ReleaseDate | Respon | Changes
//  -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
//  v2_01.00.00  | 30.09.2013  | STL    | First release
//  v2_01.01.00  | 28.01.2014  | SMOH   | Combine LASD Options 27 and 18 + Option14(BMV1T)--> Option27 + Busmaster--> Option14
//  v2_01.02.00  | 14.02.2014  | SMOH   | Encompass ExhaustUnit Option into Option12 + Delete Option6, Option17 and Option 9+ Include Temp HE_2 for PCL
//  v2_01.03.00  | 15.04.2014  | SMOH   | Option22 converted to BoostAirSupply
//  v2_01.04.00  | 28.04.2014  | KLCH   | Bugfix: correction of Option14 (export for HMI not ok)
//  v2_01.05.00  | 15.12.2014  | STL    | AddOn: Nozzle exchanger
//  v2_01.06.00  | 18.11.2015  | STL    | Change: Option26 (BAP1P) (0 -> 1)
//  v2_01.07.00  | 10.10.2016  | RHI    | AddOn: KeStudio XML Version
//  v2_01.08.00  | 17.10.2016  | STL    | AddOn: HelpGun as option
//  v2_01.09.00  | 21.11.2016  | KLCH   | Change: new option OptionGun; modification of items
//  v2_01.10.00  | 21.12.2016  | RHI    | AddOn: Option Cooling Device
//  v2_01.11.00  | 12.01.2017  | KLCH   | Change: Option5 (BMV2PE) (0 -> 1)
//  v2_01.12.00  | 23.08.2017  | KLCH   | Change: Option14 (Profibus -> Sercos III); TempHE (1 -> 0); EcoTempAxis1 (Not existing -> Air cooled large); EcoTempAxis3 (Not existing -> Air cooled small); ElectricalVersion(Version 1 -> Version 2)
//  v2_01.13.00  | 12.12.2017  | KLCH   | Change: modified selection for circulation
//  v2_01.14.00  | 20.03.2018  | KTO    | AddOn: KeStudio Version 3.20+ and RCMP / RCMP2, set "KeStudio 3.20+ and RCMP (Sercos3 drives)" as default
//  v2_01.15.00  | 24.04.2018  | KLCH   | AddOn: OptionRobType, OptionSafetyType
//  v2_01.16.00  | 02.10.2018  | KLCH   | Change: modified selection for renamed RobType (OptionRobType), SafetyType (OptionSafetyType)

